{
  "name": "iOS — Cold-Start Span Timings",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "name": "Cold start",
      "stylistic_components": [
        {
          "id": "t-intro-h",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "iOS — where does cold start time actually go?",
            "variant": "h2"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 3 }
        },
        {
          "id": "t-intro-p",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "`app_cold_start` is a root span opened at the end of CaptureBridge.start(), back-dated (startTimeInterval) to the true kernel process-start time. Three child spans nest under it via parentSpanID — sdk_init (Logger.start() plus setEntityID/addField/reportPreviousRun), scene_render (SwiftUI standing up the window through first task dispatch), and state_restore (the demo's own prefs/flag bookkeeping) — so a single cold start also renders as one waterfall in Timeline. See ColdStartSpans in CaptureBridge.swift and bd-shop-20 in workflows/. Because workflow matching runs on-device against every span as it's emitted, these are exact per-session numbers, not a sample — every cold start any device produces contributes to the histograms below.",
            "variant": "p"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 3, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 8 }
        },
        {
          "id": "t-s1-h",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "All three phases, compared",
            "variant": "h3"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 11, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 3 }
        },
        {
          "id": "t-s1-p",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "One chart, one line per phase — use this to see which phase dominates overall cold-start time, and whether a regression traces to SDK init, SwiftUI scene stand-up, or the demo's own bookkeeping.",
            "variant": "p"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 14, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 4 }
        },
        {
          "id": "t-s2-h",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "Per-phase detail (full P50/P90/P99)",
            "variant": "h3"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 34, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 3 }
        },
        {
          "id": "t-s2-p",
          "text_component": {
            "text": "Each phase's own full percentile breakdown — the compared chart above shows only one percentile at a time per line; these four show the full P50/P90/P99 spread for the overall total and each individual phase.",
            "variant": "p"
          },
          "dashboard_layout_settings": { "x": 0, "y": 37, "column_span": 12, "row_span": 4 }
        }
